WEBVTT

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.630
<i>What you’re saying is impossible.</i>

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>I can’t...</i>

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.410
<i>I told you, I’m...</i>

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:28.020
<i>Really...</i>

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.020
<i>I am...</i>

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.760
<i>It’s really impossible...</i>

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.480
<i>Wait, I can’t!</i>

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.640
<i>I told you, I’m not...</i>

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:37.600
<i>Please, wait!</i>

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.560
<i>No... No~!</i>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:39.910
<i>No... No~!</i>

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Please come in!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.180
Welcome to Café Mew Mew.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:09.800
For a limited time, a special Afternoon
Cake Set will be served free!

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.680
Hi, excuse me. Two over there?

00:01:12.680 --> 00:01:15.650
You’ll be served in a moment.
Please take a seat over there.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:17.970
Tada~! Now it’s “Show-time with Bu-Ling”!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:20.570
Todays subject is “Balancing on the ball”!

00:01:20.570 --> 00:01:21.900
Don’t you do this everytime?

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:24.920
Heh heh heh... there’s our trusty Akasaka-san.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:26.140
Someone called?

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:30.450
Bu-Ling decided to balance on a ball, a
skill developed through careful study.

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:32.220
Excuse me, did
someone ask for me?

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:33.440
Nya! One of the 48 hidden skills passed
down from the Wong family!

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.440
Umm, excuse me...?

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:36.540
Killer attack! Get on the Baa-reh~

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.360
That’s what you call a skill?

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.250
Balancing is hard.

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.210
If you don’t believe me, come try it!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.300
No thanks!

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.340
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:49.010
Service cake se...se...set!

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:51.600
Wow Retasu,
didn’t know you can do that!

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:56.890
Don’t be afraid. You must keep this
posture or everything will fall.

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:59.260
Help me, plea..a..a..a~

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.720
Two cake sets...

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.000
...there’s the tip from “Show-Time”

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:07.060
We got tips?

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.290
10 yen.

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.040
Well, 5 yen.

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:12.690
Thank you very much.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:17.130
Ahh... so tired...

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:21.290
It’s good you guys kept things under control.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.050
Minto, why don’t you lend us a hand?

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.520
Always, always, always, always, just talk.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:28.870
Ichigo. weren’t you late again today?

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.970
I may look like a normal girl, but
within me is the spirit of a cat.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.220
Nevertheless, I try my best.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:39.400
Minto’s concern over this matter is... what now?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:43.650
You don’t need to mention
the obvious.

00:02:43.650 --> 00:02:44.900
Well then?

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:49.490
Ichigo, exactly what’s your purpose for being here?

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.860
Huh? To work in the café part-time...

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.620
You seem to get it all wrong.

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:55.480
Huh?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:03:01.170
Listen. We were specifically chosen
to be the guardians of the Earth.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:07.170
Whenever, wherever or whatever happens,
we’ve to be there as fast as we can...

00:03:07.170 --> 00:03:11.460
This café, this arrangement, is in every sense a cover.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:17.420
Now, the one who’s always early for work everyday - Me.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.390
The one who’s always late and being a nuisance - You.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:26.650
Given a job and not doing it right,
whose fault is it?

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.650
Minto is so mean! Mean Minto!

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.950
My my, struck a nerve now, did I?

00:03:31.390 --> 00:03:32.410
Meanie!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:33.410
Ohh, that...

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.110
Do guys make you weak all over?

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:40.070
Since you don’t care to change, we’re
unable to discuss this calmly.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.020
That doesn’t scare me.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:43.820
Enough of this!

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.420
Let’s not resort to violence.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.170
Shirogane? What is it?

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.790
There’s something to show you all.
Have everyone assemble below.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:54.300
What happened to this little thing?

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.090
It seems to be hurt...

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.930
We found it at the lake this morning.

00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:00.850
It was hurt, and couldn’t fly.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:02.050
Poor thing...

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.010
Now, look carefully...

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:12.780
It seems to have fully recovered.

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.690
What’s this?

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:17.030
Drops of “Mew Aqua” were just applied.

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.150
Mew Aqua?

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:24.080
Mew Aqua, in simple terms, is crystalline
water with a high level of purity.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:27.040
It’s said to have the ability to revitalize the body.

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:29.550
If one were to get hurt, it can be
applied and they will recover.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:33.120
That is simply unheard of.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:36.470
Yep... we also find it hard to believe.

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:37.760
Huh?

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:38.130
Retasu!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.850
Y-Yes!

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:44.520
The other day at sea, do you remember
how your body changed?

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:52.600
Y-Yes. It was like a dream at the time...
so I have difficulty remembering.

00:04:58.950 --> 00:05:01.530
Retasu changed into a mermaid as
a result of Mew Aqua’s influence.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.950
What?

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:07.700
When we saw that possibility, more in depth studies revealed the secret behind it.

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:13.420
These drops of Mew Aqua are possibly
residue left behind by the original.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:17.180
Its power is only fractions of a hundred millionth.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:22.220
However, the complete crystalline Mew
Aqua exists somewhere out there.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.430
That will do as an introduction for now.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.130
The full Mew Aqua possess the power...

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:29.610
...to affect the Earth’s environment, even completely altering it.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:33.680
Finding and retrieving it will be our top priority.

00:05:35.610 --> 00:05:36.740
That’s it...

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.730
There, everything’s alright now.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:46.700
What is it?

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:53.760
Go on, your friends are
all waiting for you.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.300
Ichigo?

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:58.670
Huh?

00:05:59.340 --> 00:06:00.350
So it’s you after all.

00:06:00.350 --> 00:06:01.900
Aha aha... Aoyama-kun!!

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:02.630
What’s that you’re doing?

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:06.630
Er... umm... nothing!
Nothing really!

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.200
Oh yes, there’s something I want to tell you, Aoyama-kun.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:14.530
Water of Miracles?

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.150
So, you haven’t heard of it?

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:18.200
Nope, sorry.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:19.410
I see.

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:21.280
But... but... but...

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.520
Wouldn’t it be great if we find it?

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:27.590
Then the environment problems
we have would be solved, right?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.360
Ichigo...

00:06:30.630 --> 00:06:32.540
Earth’s environment...

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.010
takes a million years to recover at nature’s rate alone...

00:06:36.010 --> 00:06:38.720
and it has only been a short ten thousand years...

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:39.920
What?

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.260
Human action and inaction, whether intentional or not,

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:45.220
...bear little meaning.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.270
...everyone’s affected...

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:50.270
Hence, we can picture a renewed Nature,

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.890
...only with human resources combined.

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:58.660
Maybe even the possibility of rediscovering
lost and extinct life.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.650
Aoyama-kun, what’s that?

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:02.560
This?

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.490
These are armbands given to volunteers
who help pick up litter.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:07.570
I’ll go too!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.570
I’ve always wanted to help.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.340
Momomiya Ichigo is going too!

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:15.990
Alright, let’s go together.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:21.000
Ichigo!!

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:24.720
How long does it take you to get to the park and back?

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:26.600
I’m sorry, something came up...

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:29.010
I’m picking up Aoyama-oniichan’s scent...

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:30.980
Minto?

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.970
You had a date with Aoyama-kun!!

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:33.930
Stop talking nonsense!

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.350
Ichigo! You misunderstood what I told you, didn’t you??

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.320
Incidents could have occurred.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.570
Nothing happened. It’s not a problem.

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:43.410
Not a problem, you say?

00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:44.360
What’s wrong?

00:07:44.620 --> 00:07:46.240
Zakuro-san!?

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.870
Oneesama! Oneesama, say something please!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.490
Ichigo was...

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:50.490
Minto,

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.470
...calm down.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.330
Wait! Minto!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.220
Minto-san!

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:04.810
Minto-oneechan!

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:08.770
Deep Blue sama has sent word.

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:13.780
No matter what, the Tokyo Mew Mew
must be eradicated.

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:16.400
He actually said that, huh?

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:18.770
We’ve been trying our best,
haven’t we?

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.560
Quiche, what’s that?

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.200
Hmm? This? I picked it up at the beach...

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:26.370
after hearing about it...

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:29.020
the true force behind the evolution
of living things on Earth.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:30.410
Mew Aqua?

00:08:30.410 --> 00:08:31.540
Correct.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:32.920
What’s that?

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:35.530
Why wasn’t Deep Blue-sama informed?

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:39.430
Ah, the problem is –
this is only a fragment.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:43.500
Oh, yes. Pie, Tart,
want to try out my plan?

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:48.270
If it works out, you might receive great
praise from Deep Blue sama.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.140
Is she resting today too?

00:09:14.310 --> 00:09:17.980
Ichigo-san, looks like
we better go get her.

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.980
Retasu and Bu-Ling can go ahead.

00:09:19.980 --> 00:09:21.240
I’ll stay.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:24.710
She might be angered further
if I go along.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.320
Ichigo-san...

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.650
Parcel delivery!

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:30.170
Yes!

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.530
Yes, yes, yes, welcome...

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:35.610
Why would anyone send something to the café? Retasu, please check it out.

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.660
Minto sent it!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:38.140
Ehh?

00:09:40.370 --> 00:09:42.080
What can it be?

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:43.100
I know!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.090
It must be she feels embarrassed to come back...

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:47.920
so she got the delivery service to help.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.260
A selection of famous candies...

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:50.880
Candy!!

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:53.400
(candy candy candy candy candy!)

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:55.360
What...?

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.030
Isn’t this...?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:58.870
How could this be...?

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:02.190
Could it be that Minto is quitting?

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.240
What should we do, Ichigo-san?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:05.580
Ichigo-san?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.400
I don’t know...

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:12.200
Things have gone too far this time.

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.550
Is there nothing more we can do?

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:16.200
I don’t know!

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.010
We can’t just give up like this!

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.490
Bu-Ling?

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:22.580
Ichigo-oneechan can’t just feel sorry and give up.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:25.340
If Minto-oneechan isn’t here,

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:29.600
Bu-Ling would have no one else to play with.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.380
Aa... well... um, that is...

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:34.650
Bu-Ling-san is still a kid...

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.640
Retasu-oneechan is so mean!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.200
Treating Bu-Ling like she’s brainless...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:42.200
That is... um, I’m sorry...
really sorry... really sorry...

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:44.310
How is it?

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:46.360
Not good. Lost it again.

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.150
How about a switch?
You should take a break.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.400
It’s Ok, I’m fine.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:52.240
But...

00:10:52.240 --> 00:10:54.950
Retasu’s transformation was witnessed
by the Aliens as well.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:55.840
Time is running out.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:59.200
We’ll lose our edge if they manage to find one.

00:10:59.200 --> 00:11:01.750
...it’ll be too late for us.

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:05.120
This is a fight where every
minute counts.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:06.060
I understand.

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.720
Do take some sandwiches.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.930
Damn, lack info, when you need it most.

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:21.180
What’s up? A rare visitor.

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:23.150
Just say so if I’m disturbing you.

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.270
Nope, what is it?

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.690
We need to talk.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.940
...regarding Minto.

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:31.320
Isn’t she always arguing?
Why must we...

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.620
Not now.

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:35.570
She’s a smart girl,

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.790
she’s witnessed much
that has happened.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.460
She might not come back anymore.

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:44.040
What do you need me to do?

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.710
Leave that to me.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:50.720
I... don’t know how to say this...

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:55.640
...but, it’s bad to overwork yourself.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:00.440
Right, got it.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.140
Zakuro, do whatever it takes.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.980
Minto must be brought back.

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:05.910
Consider this an order!

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:07.270
Understood.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.060
And Zakuro...

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.990
...are you really a High School student?

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:16.590
It’s best not to ask a woman’s age.

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:22.700
Oh well, shall we go take a look?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.220
Huh?

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.710
Everybody, to Minto’s house.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:27.820
Ichigo-san!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.640
What was that?!

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:32.600
This is!?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:34.380
Keiichirou, what was that?!

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.550
4.2 on the Richter Scale...

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.380
The epicenter is right under the city.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:39.020
What?

00:12:39.390 --> 00:12:41.760
Readings show what resembles a huge living organism.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.350
This is no ordinary quake.

00:12:43.350 --> 00:12:47.900
Energy readings indicate that it’s the Aliens.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.020
Is everyone here?

00:12:50.020 --> 00:12:50.870
Shirogane?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:53.770
Time to go! That earthquake was the Aliens’ doing!

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.330
It’s from underground.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.280
But Minto and Zakuro-san are...

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.300
No time for that!!

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:01.070
They are searching for Mew Aqua!

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.280
The Earth will be finished
if they use that!

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.510
They must be stopped!

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.510
Tokyo Mew Mew! Let’s go!

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:07.510
Mew Mew Pudding!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:08.470
Mew Mew Lettuce!

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:09.890
Mew Mew Strawberry!

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.470
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.010
Are you always like this?

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.060
I am not going back.

00:13:46.060 --> 00:13:46.870
Why?

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:49.510
Why? It won’t do any good.

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.470
What do you mean?

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:51.640
It’s the fighting.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.140
Why wouldn’t it do any good?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.850
Because it’s useless...

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:56.130
Useless?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.170
How can you tell?

00:13:57.170 --> 00:14:01.340
Of course I can. 5 people protecting
the whole Earth is just crazy.

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.930
I hate to do anything that’s useless.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.240
Even if the Earth is conquered by the Aliens?

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.200
I don’t care!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.360
Even if all living beings die out?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:10.810
That’s right.

00:14:10.810 --> 00:14:11.820
I see...

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.330
Then dying now won’t
make a difference?

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:22.670
Look at this.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.410
This is Mew Aqua?

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:27.740
Wow, beautiful isn’t it?

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.700
Isn’t it cool? Piece of cake...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:30.140
Huh?

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:31.710
This is...

00:14:31.710 --> 00:14:32.920
Why Quiche?

00:14:32.920 --> 00:14:34.630
Hurry up, let’s bring it back.

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:35.600
That won’t happen.

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:39.980
Digging like this to cause an earthquake...
subway workers must be really angry.

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:44.940
By the Reborn Spirit, we’ll be of service!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.310
Speaking of which,
hand over the Mew Aqua!

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.270
Sure.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:49.850
Huh?

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:50.310
What?!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:50.780
Quiche?!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.740
But handing it over like this
isn’t proper.

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:57.250
How about adding a little something.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:01.700
FUSION!!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.460
Ouch!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:16.980
Please stop, oneesama!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.760
Why? Why are you doing this?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:26.060
Miki?

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.220
Please stop it, oneesama!

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.060
He’s not involved with this!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:32.650
There! Miki, run away!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:43.370
This puppy...

00:15:44.320 --> 00:15:46.990
I won’t let you lay a finger on him!

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.620
Even if it’s oneesama...

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:51.750
Never... Never!

00:15:53.040 --> 00:15:55.680
Found it now? The reason to fight.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.710
Saying you don’t care when you do.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.010
You’re just like Ichigo.

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:04.620
Though she may not think like you,

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:07.100
...she’s always looking ahead.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:08.600
So...

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:13.730
Oneesama...

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.150
Yaah! Minto-oneechan!?

00:16:22.150 --> 00:16:23.670
Minto-san!?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:25.630
Minto!? What are you...?

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:27.540
I am... I am...

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.080
I am... I am...

00:16:30.830 --> 00:16:34.540
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.360
MintonArrow!!

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:12.880
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.640
I just can’t get through.

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.350
Ichigo, Minto...

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:21.100
get on it’s back and attack from above.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:22.640
Okay!

00:17:23.390 --> 00:17:27.100
Nya, nyayayayaaaaaaaaa...

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:29.020
Nya!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.150
That’s...

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:33.900
Minto!

00:17:34.890 --> 00:17:38.620
Reborn... Mint ECHO!!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:06.350
Reborn... Lettuce
RUSH!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:06.350
Reborn... PuddingRings
INFERNO!

00:18:10.970 --> 00:18:14.240
Reborn... Strawberry SURPRISE!!

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:29.240
What is this...

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:32.130
Ichigo-san, are you alright?

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:35.130
Float, float, keep going! Float, float...

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.140
That’s all Mew Aqua can do?

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:39.950
Nope. It’s just another
crystalline material.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:40.600
What?

00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:42.160
What we just saw...

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:45.060
...is just a glimpse of its true power.

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.500
Well then, let’s get out of here!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:51.020
It seems Mew Aqua won’t be found so easily.

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.890
Wuahh! I’m wet all over.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:18:58.810
Ichigo...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.560
What is it, Minto?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.270
I wanted to tell you...

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:05.810
Oh yeah, Minto’s place is
just nearby, isn’t it?

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.000
Huh? Yes that’s right...

00:19:08.900 --> 00:19:12.490
By the way, how does it turn out like this?

00:19:11.240 --> 00:19:12.490
It’s so nice.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:14.410
This is the first time I’ve worn this...

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.280
It’s all silk, please try it on.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.700
Now listen here!...

00:19:17.700 --> 00:19:20.680
Minto, you’ve been sleeping in this big room all this time?

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.760
No, my room was destroyed
by oneesama...

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:25.330
Hey, Minto?

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:26.840
What is it now?

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.510
Waii! Minto is till the same!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:32.920
What? What’s that?

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.890
Now for a welcome back hug!

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:37.310
Ichigo! Let go!

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.900
Well, well...

00:19:49.980 --> 00:19:52.410
That was a good show, Miki.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.910
Take that!

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:04.410
Speaking of bad things, our thoughts were
cleared when we picked up the pillows.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:07.210
After many, many hits...

00:20:07.210 --> 00:20:11.000
until feathers flew all over the place...

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.550
Then, it just seemed so wonderful...

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.970
Just like all these feathers,

00:20:14.970 --> 00:20:17.890
Everything bad... flew away!

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.400
I’ve been to the beach and saw the fireworks...

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:28.320
Ahh! Summer is so fun!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.860
However, it’s about to end.

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:32.670
I hate that. I won’t let it end if I can help it.

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:36.000
No, it’s ending just like in the tale of the “Box”.

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.340
You’re so mean!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:39.960
My relationship with Aoyama-kun will not end!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:43.630
Next: “Farewell Summer, Ichigo’s Longest Day”

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:46.550
I told you, please don’t mention “farewell”.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.310
Ichigo-san, what do you plan to do?

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.510
You obviously haven’t finished your homework.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:53.320
NOOoooo~.....!
